  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "31404412",
      "title": "Providing Visual Validation Feedback",
      "lectureOrder": 157,
      "videoOrder": 153,
      "sourceHash": "58cb18f089603815e956ef0fd066fd509e44fb7866b3a656c994d414ccb837a3",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.02,
          "end": 5.43,
          "en": "So how could we provide feedback to the user?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.43,
          "end": 8.33,
          "en": "Well, I would like to highlight the inputs",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.33,
          "end": 9.76,
          "en": "that are problematic.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.76,
          "end": 12.31,
          "en": "I would like to highlight their labels",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.31,
          "end": 16.72,
          "en": "and the input elements themselves by changing their styles.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.72,
          "end": 19.66,
          "en": "In addition, I want to output an error message directly",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.66,
          "end": 21.92,
          "en": "in the user interface.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.92,
          "end": 25.07,
          "en": "Now to achieve this we can change",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.07,
          "end": 27.3,
          "en": "our input values state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 27.3,
          "end": 28.133,
          "en": "a little bit.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 29.02,
          "end": 32.78,
          "en": "Instead of just storing the values here as values.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 32.78,
          "end": 35.5,
          "en": "So just the entered values as values",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 35.5,
          "end": 37.145,
          "en": "for our different identifiers.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 37.145,
          "end": 40.25,
          "en": "We could store objects here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 40.25,
          "end": 42.627,
          "en": "Objects that have a value property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 42.627,
          "end": 47.627,
          "en": "but objects that also have a Is Valid property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 48.25,
          "end": 51.99,
          "en": "Now this Is Valid property could be true or false",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 51.99,
          "end": 55.76,
          "en": "and it actually also depends on the initial value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 55.76,
          "end": 59.8,
          "en": "Therefore, we can basically repeat this check here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 61.49,
          "end": 63.97,
          "en": "and if default values are provided.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 63.97,
          "end": 66.79,
          "en": "So if we are editing an existing expense,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 66.79,
          "end": 69.35,
          "en": "we know that we will have a valid value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 69.35,
          "end": 70.62,
          "en": "right from the start.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 70.62,
          "end": 73.12,
          "en": "Otherwise we will have an invalid value right",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 73.12,
          "end": 75.77,
          "en": "from the start because we start with an empty string.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 77.1,
          "end": 81.937,
          "en": "So therefore here, we can do that for all these values here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 81.937,
          "end": 86.937,
          "en": "For all our inputs, and also split this into a value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 87.746,
          "end": 91.713,
          "en": "And the Is Valid property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 92.62,
          "end": 96.93,
          "en": "where Is Valid also takes to default value into account",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 96.93,
          "end": 99.503,
          "en": "and is either true or false based on it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 100.97,
          "end": 102.961,
          "en": "And we also do this for the description",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 102.961,
          "end": 105.1,
          "en": "where we have the value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 106.00999999999999,
          "end": 107.913,
          "en": "and then Is Valid.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 110.07,
          "end": 112.463,
          "en": "And we use the same approach as before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 113.97999999999999,
          "end": 115.91,
          "en": "And actually we can shorten this instead",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 115.91,
          "end": 118.13,
          "en": "of having this ternary expression",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 118.13,
          "end": 121.55,
          "en": "we can just use this approach, which will convert a truthy",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 121.55,
          "end": 126.253,
          "en": "or falsy value into a real boolean, into true or false.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 126.253,
          "end": 129.67,
          "en": "So if we have no default values, this will yield false.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 129.67,
          "end": 132.743,
          "en": "If we have default values, this will yield true.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 134.22,
          "end": 136.26,
          "en": "With that we don't just have the values",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 136.26,
          "end": 139.46,
          "en": "but also the validities and therefore I'll change",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 139.46,
          "end": 142.61,
          "en": "the state name to inputs and set inputs",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 142.61,
          "end": 145.93,
          "en": "because now it's not just the values, but the values",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 145.93,
          "end": 148.29,
          "en": "plus more information.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 148.29,
          "end": 150.44,
          "en": "In this case, the more information,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 150.44,
          "end": 153.363,
          "en": "the extra information is the validity.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 154.32,
          "end": 156.1,
          "en": "This of course means that we need to update",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 156.1,
          "end": 157.95,
          "en": "a couple of places in our code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 157.95,
          "end": 160.32999999999998,
          "en": "Here for example, we update set inputs",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 160.32999999999998,
          "end": 162.85,
          "en": "or recall set inputs now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 162.85,
          "end": 164.9,
          "en": "We get our current inputs",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 164.9,
          "end": 168.9,
          "en": "and we wanna distribute our current input data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 168.9,
          "end": 170.187,
          "en": "into this new object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 170.187,
          "end": 173.85,
          "en": "But when we update one specific identifier",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 173.85,
          "end": 176.07,
          "en": "we actually want to update the value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 176.07,
          "end": 180.738,
          "en": "of that identifier and set it to the entered value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 180.738,
          "end": 185.18,
          "en": "I will also always set the validity to true then",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 185.18,
          "end": 189.01,
          "en": "because when I'm entering something, I actually do assume",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 189.01,
          "end": 192.36,
          "en": "that it's valid and we will change it back to false later",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 192.36,
          "end": 196.95,
          "en": "if we detect that it was invalid after submission.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 196.95,
          "end": 200.15,
          "en": "So that's why I will always set Is Valid to true",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 200.15,
          "end": 204.11,
          "en": "if some value was entered, even if it should be invalid",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 204.11,
          "end": 206.725,
          "en": "just so that I assume that it is correct.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 206.725,
          "end": 210.22,
          "en": "And we then do revalidate it later.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 210.22,
          "end": 212.66,
          "en": "There would be alternative ways of handling this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 212.66,
          "end": 215.403,
          "en": "but that is an approach that I want to use here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 216.74,
          "end": 219.77,
          "en": "Now, we also need to update more places in our code though",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 219.77,
          "end": 223.26,
          "en": "for example, here, where we collect the entered data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 223.26,
          "end": 225.54,
          "en": "we now have to use inputs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 225.54,
          "end": 229.495,
          "en": "That's our new state name, inputs instead of input values.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 229.495,
          "end": 232.2,
          "en": "And for the amount we are interested",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 232.2,
          "end": 234.235,
          "en": "in the value for the date, we are now interested",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 234.235,
          "end": 237.303,
          "en": "in the value and for the description as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 239.43,
          "end": 242.066,
          "en": "And then we also need to update our two-way binding.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 242.066,
          "end": 247.066,
          "en": "Here we now use inputs.amount.value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 249.216,
          "end": 250.873,
          "en": "That is what we wanna bind in here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 250.873,
          "end": 252.29,
          "en": "And we have to make the same changes down here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 252.29,
          "end": 256.05,
          "en": "It is inputs.date.value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 256.05,
          "end": 260.533,
          "en": "and it is inputs.description.value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 261.77,
          "end": 263.65,
          "en": "And that should be all.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 263.65,
          "end": 265,
          "en": "Now, why am I doing the that?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 265,
          "end": 268.47,
          "en": "Because now when we determine that something is invalid",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 268.47,
          "end": 270.168,
          "en": "instead of using this alert",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 270.168,
          "end": 273.648,
          "en": "I wanna update the validity here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 273.648,
          "end": 276.53,
          "en": "in my if check where I detected",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 276.53,
          "end": 278.967,
          "en": "that at least one input is invalid.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 278.967,
          "end": 283.90999999999997,
          "en": "I want to call set inputs and use this function form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 283.90999999999997,
          "end": 287.47,
          "en": "of updating it to get current inputs,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 287.47,
          "end": 290.421,
          "en": "but to then return a new object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 290.421,
          "end": 293.28,
          "en": "where I update the data stored",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 293.28,
          "end": 296.6,
          "en": "for all my inputs, for the amount, for example",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 296.6,
          "end": 298.02,
          "en": "I will keep the entered value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 298.02,
          "end": 299.83,
          "en": "I don't wanna change this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 299.83,
          "end": 302.98,
          "en": "So I will access current inputs.amount.value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 302.98,
          "end": 304.64,
          "en": "and keep that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 304.64,
          "end": 309.63,
          "en": "But I will set Is Valid to to the result of amount Is Valid.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 309.63,
          "end": 312,
          "en": "So to the result stored in this constant here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 312,
          "end": 313.683,
          "en": "I will use that down here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 314.66,
          "end": 317.037,
          "en": "And we use the same approach for the other inputs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 317.037,
          "end": 320.571,
          "en": "For the date, we keep the entered value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 320.571,
          "end": 323.6,
          "en": "So we keep current input state.value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 323.6,
          "end": 326.453,
          "en": "but the validity is set to date Is Valid.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 327.92,
          "end": 332,
          "en": "And for the description we keep",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 332,
          "end": 336.86,
          "en": "current inputs.description.value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 336.86,
          "end": 340.193,
          "en": "but we set Is Valid to description Is Valid.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 341.15,
          "end": 343,
          "en": "So now we update this state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 343,
          "end": 346.07,
          "en": "If we determine that something invalid was entered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 346.93,
          "end": 348.79,
          "en": "and now we can use data information",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 348.79,
          "end": 351.8,
          "en": "in our JSX code to update the look",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 351.8,
          "end": 355.633,
          "en": "of these inputs, to, for example, change the label to red.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 356.63,
          "end": 359.26,
          "en": "I will do that soon, but before I do that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 359.26,
          "end": 362.07,
          "en": "I wanna start with a simple error message",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 362.07,
          "end": 364.65,
          "en": "that I will output below my inputs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 364.65,
          "end": 369.27,
          "en": "Here I'll add a new text, like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 369.27,
          "end": 373.13,
          "en": "And I only wanna show this text if we have an invalid input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 373.13,
          "end": 375.93,
          "en": "So I will render this text conditionally",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 375.93,
          "end": 380.86,
          "en": "by checking input.amount Is Valid.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 380.86,
          "end": 384.73,
          "en": "And if that is not valid, or if one",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 384.73,
          "end": 386.36,
          "en": "of the other inputs is not valid,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 386.36,
          "end": 388.18,
          "en": "I wanna show this text.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 388.18,
          "end": 390.78,
          "en": "Now instead of checking this all in line here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 390.78,
          "end": 393.81,
          "en": "I will add a little helper constant before we return",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 393.81,
          "end": 398.597,
          "en": "to JSX code, which I will name form Is Invalid.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 398.597,
          "end": 403.597,
          "en": "And here I will simply check if inputs.amount Is Valid",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 404.05,
          "end": 406.98,
          "en": "is false by adding this exclamation mark",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 406.98,
          "end": 411.016,
          "en": "or if inputs.date Is Valid is false",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 411.016,
          "end": 413.79,
          "en": "by adding this exclamation mark.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 413.79,
          "end": 418.79,
          "en": "Or if inputs.description is not valid.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 419.9,
          "end": 422.3,
          "en": "If one of those conditions should be true.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 422.3,
          "end": 425.37,
          "en": "So if one of those inputs is not valid, then I know",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 425.37,
          "end": 429.936,
          "en": "that the overall form is not valid, that it is invalid.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 429.936,
          "end": 432.45,
          "en": "And we can use this helper constant down there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 432.45,
          "end": 435.16,
          "en": "to conditionally show some text.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
